  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiji Rural WASH Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rotary New Zealand World Community Service will work in partnership with Rotary Pacific Water, to improve health and well-being in rural communities&#xA0;in Macuata and Serua. The program focuses on constructing resilient water and sanitation systems, enhancing technical capacity in sustainable groundwater engineering, and promoting hygiene behaviour change. It targets 12 villages and schools, empowering local communities through training, inclusive infrastructure, and active engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
